#CHLOEAI:1
TYPE="path_rules"
GLOB="Sources/**, {{ProjectName}}/**"

LANGUAGE_RUNTIME:
- Swift 5.10+ (fill in Xcode version, e.g. "Xcode 15.3")
- Minimum deployment target: (fill in, e.g. "iOS 17.0")
- SPM for dependencies — no CocoaPods unless legacy requirement

BUILD:
- xcodebuild -scheme {{ProjectName}} -configuration Debug build
- swift build (if SPM-only, no Xcode)

STYLE_CONVENTIONS:
- SwiftLint rules enforced — fix warnings, do not silence without comment
- swift-format for formatting — do not hand-format
- Prefer SwiftUI over UIKit for new views
- `@MainActor` on view models and UI-touching code
- No force-unwrap (`!`) except in tests and @IBOutlet — use guard or if let

FORBIDDEN_PATTERNS:
- No force-unwrap in production code (fatalError with message is acceptable)
- No hardcoded strings visible to users — use Localizable.strings
- No synchronous network calls on the main thread
- No secrets in source — use Keychain or environment config

EXPLICITLY_NOT_TOUCHING:
- (fill in: generated files, third-party vendored code, etc.)
